{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.hana.third",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "上京那天，去车站接她",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.hana.third",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.hana.third",
    "idolId": "hana",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "text": "站台。新干线到站，人从检票口涌出来。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "──啊",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "有了，制作人先生──！",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "text": "她拖着一个不大的行李箱跑过来，头发被风吹得有点乱。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "那个……今天开始受您照顾了，我是鈴木羽那！",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "长途辛苦了。……这么郑重，谢谢。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "还有，敬语不用勉强也可以的。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "这样啊──那，敬语就不用了。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "……彼此都是哦？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶──……这样啊，知道了。谢谢。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "啊哈……！",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "text": "行李箱比想象中小。她说，够用了。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "冈山到东京，比想象中要远呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "坐新干线三个多小时吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "嗯……不过，也比想象中快。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "──我已经决定了。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "要当偶像。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "朋友说，我不去太可惜了。妈妈也说到时候再说，弟弟在起哄。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "大家都这么说，那大概就是对的吧──",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……不是\"大家都这么说\"也行。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "？",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "你自己怎么想？",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "我自己，也想试试看。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……好。那就去试。"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
  "createdAt": "2026-11-01T12:00:00.000Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-11-01T12:00:00.000Z",
